  "body": "<p>This Pull Request updates dependency <a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint\">sass-lint</a> from <code>v1.11.1</code> to <code>v1.12.1</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"commits\">Commits</h3>\n<p><details><br />\n<summary>sasstools/sass-lint</summary></p>\n<h4 id=\"1121\">1.12.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/508c135863b408d5dac45a18beccb96c230207ef\"><code>508c135</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1151 from sasstools/hotfix/use-gonzales-fork</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/9a5196d363f06e6e374ea50c6d68cdf8270da1e1\"><code>9a5196d</code></a> hotfix update gonzales</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/aec4b187c0697366d9d9c7f5ca3a6248ccca9729\"><code>aec4b18</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1148 from sasstools/v1-dev</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"1120\">1.12.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/07d41dfb326597a6b7fdc727989086458a7f5983\"><code>07d41df</code></a> Merge branch &#x27;develop&#x27; into v1-dev</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/50e21f5a464e51dba371aef15e05d2384a069c24\"><code>50e21f5</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1123 from sasstools/v1-dev</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/978dbd8a6611ff7bd36c428d13a4d299494cac54\"><code>978dbd8</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1147 from DanPurdy/feature/prepare-v1-12-0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/b126b4c57b3000b6541a7ed33c5ea15806aeb166\"><code>b126b4c</code></a> :shipit: Prepare v1.12.0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/1f2718de1f5f430296ffc64e36429f11eba08a2d\"><code>1f2718d</code></a> :shipit: Prepare 1.12.0</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/f44a2162251a578d1d857fc5622d1437d9606076\"><code>f44a216</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1131 from sasstools/feature/ignore-interpolation-class-names</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/24ef9ba97555d6049daf35aec082e52337916e98\"><code>24ef9ba</code></a> Check for non strings for gonales methods</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/241e5a01eed1e15116f721792afb7fa1e6d28318\"><code>241e5a0</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1144 from occupant/Update-Concentric-property-sort-order</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/4c298460bac1d3c3c8081faadf077ddcee611d3c\"><code>4c29846</code></a> Add updated CSS properties</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/72f4cad72e55d3b2b835d05a7aede1b81dc610aa\"><code>72f4cad</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1128 from sasstools/feature_update-variable-for-property</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/485a461c72dff45bdd3b1190c15f1d62804ecd60\"><code>485a461</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1135 from DanPurdy/feature/sasslintrc</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/deabaf663ccd268f8a979ccd4ca995123145d1af\"><code>deabaf6</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1133 from sasstools/feature/fix-output</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/3b83d6fa7fb0f5b1dea2515c23c2e778310ce3ed\"><code>3b83d6f</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1132 from sasstools/feature/npm-ignore</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/d977a2fe1cb85dd157e8f9a29418be1f3961d417\"><code>d977a2f</code></a> 📝 Add basic sasslintrc docs</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/554056bc5071f031ca3fe9fbea70117108cdae41\"><code>554056b</code></a> ✅ Fix tests</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/433b57c196af4e21e854b1dfd632c1186d5438f9\"><code>433b57c</code></a> include test files</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/ed93438322dde69522351ec46a3d529a99a6209b\"><code>ed93438</code></a> 🎨 Fix test issues</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/ebd85116ddfc004e668c20038b5ff6499e299db5\"><code>ebd8511</code></a> 🎨 Add support for .sasslintrc</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/64cec28c3eec2d7ccf98c13de4634ff474e71e23\"><code>64cec28</code></a> 🎨 Update JSDoc</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/15cc7c87cce1b4966f578869e4942a51bbda9483\"><code>15cc7c8</code></a> ✅ Unfix lint issues</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/9aa2ccb107cb1df3ff7c3742620e18f776582f81\"><code>9aa2ccb</code></a> ✅ Add output validity test</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/9eaeef392c81ca3c1aa02c3450d6332389548aab\"><code>9eaeef3</code></a> 🐛 Fix CLI output</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/1c6197bbf097c05ffd6d438cb1b7e245d730afed\"><code>1c6197b</code></a> 💚 Fix lint issues</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/93268c6702501c3c4f7193b4a8561837c12212c8\"><code>93268c6</code></a> 🐎 Add npmignore</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/6c8f13fa29d74152816c85f8feacf41eee0f76e9\"><code>6c8f13f</code></a> 🐛 ignore interpolation in class-name-format</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/ca0690b24c70cae22a960a27cc6329fa86944f5e\"><code>ca0690b</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1129 from sasstools/feature/Fix-atrules-space-colon</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/a214c4f63f71d4767d0fdd816362d2f5fdfe7fa3\"><code>a214c4f</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1127 from sasstools/feature_fix-functions-rgba</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/94ad31e7d4fe9ab8ec572c67f9c66f621fbe3ac0\"><code>94ad31e</code></a> 🐛 Fix at-root in space after colon</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/8d0ae41a20f37849433217b16816be105b0e3514\"><code>8d0ae41</code></a> 🐛 Fix the custom proeprties test</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/f1427932394e26b0ab7f6afdc88b94d34c6e3e64\"><code>f142793</code></a> 🐛 Allow custom properties as variables</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/31d834371b9c92264168a49f33d461066e295b43\"><code>31d8343</code></a> 🔍 Update variable for property options</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/1eb2b5b9319d13414664c13bdf268635e43c8990\"><code>1eb2b5b</code></a> Allow functions &amp; custom props in rgba params</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/658f4c42e6e130ad067736f943449512b9095c00\"><code>658f4c4</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1125 from bgriffith/hotfix/is-undefined</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/8e34fa3d34deb35d8c25f5ce33ef7bf864678971\"><code>8e34fa3</code></a> 🐛 Check before calling is method</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/9fd26f2c4773c467441e84c7b51948915f3ed7c5\"><code>9fd26f2</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1038 from kopacki/patch-1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/8e7c398aba0516a20f32ba79faacf0c1bb2ed6e8\"><code>8e7c398</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1124 from sasstools/feature_fix-color-keywords</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/9ee433045e40dc1c23958af80d8e7ec8f797c879\"><code>9ee4330</code></a> Tidy up no-color-keywords logic</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/e31abb6230815c3f49f97b322cb968526fa5ba10\"><code>e31abb6</code></a> Check for custom properties in no-color-keywords</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/373d345aded602a9d4ca563dd48653163db0d71d\"><code>373d345</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1122 from sasstools/feature_fix-custom-var-misspelled</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/56ca1df4960e852b1caa8b85f53c02063039bf61\"><code>56ca1df</code></a> 🐛 Fix custom properties in declarations</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/e3d0d9aeb994c591381a763764f44a04dd6a3da1\"><code>e3d0d9a</code></a> Merge pull request #&#8203;1119 from sasstools/feature_update-packages</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/ee8076c7ed81b83f23154222343885fab96d8a87\"><code>ee8076c</code></a> add minimum node version</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/sasstools/sass-lint/commit/7a907528e93ccc05f6bdc1cea92c57e2854a6e79\"><code>7a90752</code></a> update all dependencies</li>\n</ul>\n<p></details></p>\n<hr />\n<p>This PR has been generated by <a href=\"https://renovateapp.com\">Renovate Bot</a>.</p>",
